 C(2020,3,"North American Plains","epidemic","NEW YORK","The pneumonia out of Wuhan is declared a pandemic on 11 March. The borders close; the cities lock; 1.2 million dead in the United States, seven million on the world's confirmed count and eighteen million by the best estimate.",toll=1238678),
